WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.704
Today is the second move. Cover and slide.

2
00:00:03.154 --> 00:00:09.966
Watch first. The first one on the page is done for you: show it, do the next one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:10.466 --> 00:00:13.045
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

4
00:00:13.545 --> 00:00:19.757
First, cut out the slide card. It is on the page after today's page. Any strip of paper works too.

5
00:00:20.207 --> 00:00:23.770
A guess needs the whole word at once. The card takes that away.

6
00:00:24.220 --> 00:00:28.713
Cover the word with the card. Slide it to the right, until one letter shows.

7
00:00:29.769 --> 00:00:30.600
Slide again.

8
00:00:31.984 --> 00:00:32.661
And again.

9
00:00:33.823 --> 00:00:34.838
The word is cap.

10
00:00:35.638 --> 00:00:41.335
Today's words start the same way. Cat, cap, can. Only the last letter tells them apart.

11
00:00:41.785 --> 00:00:45.477
So a guess from the first letter fails, and your child can see why.

12
00:00:45.927 --> 00:00:49.818
Do the first row together with the card. Your child does the other rows.

13
00:00:50.268 --> 00:00:56.862
For job two, press play on your child's listening track and step away. The voice waits, then says each word.

14
00:00:57.312 --> 00:00:59.824
At the end, your child reads three words to you.
